    "notes": "# Otosora 0.8.2\n\n## Windows\n- New installer: `otosora-v0.8.2-windows-x64-setup.exe`. It installs Otosora for your user without asking for admin rights, adds it to the Start menu (and the desktop, if you tick the box) and to Apps & features for uninstalling.\n- Installed this way, updates from the Updates page install quietly in the background and Otosora opens again by itself.\n- The zip is still there if you prefer a folder you run from anywhere. If you move to the installer, delete the old unzipped folder afterwards; your library, playlists and settings stay.\n",
